  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of shelter through UNHCR &amp; Libyan Red Crescent on Tunisian border and Ajdabya respectively.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Provision of shelter through UNHCR &amp; Libyan Red Crescent on Tunisian border and Ajdabya respectively. is a component of Libya Humanitarian Situation reported by FCDO with a funding type of 105 -  Humanitarian assistance and a budget of &#xa3;1,454,664. This project benefits North of Sahara, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Material relief assistance and services.</narrative>
  </description>
